---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t RIGHT JOIN u ON t.a = u.a AND t.b = 'x' AND u.d = 'y' WHERE u.a > 1 AND t.c > 1"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (a#0 == a#3)
   :- Project [a#0]
   :  +- Filter ((c#2 > 1L) and (b#1 == 'x'))
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
   +- Project [a#3]
      +- Filter ((a#3 > 1) and (d#4 == 'y'))
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
